<<include"Carter NPC Character Menu Avatar Display">>

<<if $CarterSocial > 50>>
    Carter Kent is your friend and classmate at Preston. Carter is the type of person to always try his best to help others, no matter what the context. He has a heart of solid gold, though often takes on more than he can chew, leading to some interesting and often embarrassing situations. Still, he always tries his best and you admire that about him. His positive attitude and playful personality can be a bit infectious at times. <br>
    <br>
<<elseif $CarterSocial > -10>>
    Carter Kent is your classmate and the do-gooder of Preston Academy. Very much on the short side, he makes up for it by always trying his best to help others. This both leads him to having a good relationship with most, but also the target of bullies or others who want to mess with him. Though he doesn’t seem to let that get to him, almost always wearing a smile on his face. He also seems cursed with incredible bad luck. <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    Carter Kent is your classmate, though he is more well-known as the clumsy do-gooder who is always falling flat on his face. He seems to mean well, but his constant positive attitude and inability to accept when he is incapable of something gets on a lot of people’s nerves. He’s also probably a snitch. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Carter: Park Clean Up")>>
    Carter will often do charity work around town, helping out at local park clean ups and other events. He lives with his parents, a police detective and reporter, along with his two brothers, Callum and Connor. He seems to get along with his dad very well, probably getting his sense of justice from him, but seems a little awkward and embarrassed around his mom. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

